# Contact form submission endpoint (static-export friendly).
# Point this at a form backend such as Formspree, Web3Forms, or Getform.
# Example (Formspree): https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
#
# If left empty, the contact form validates and shows a success state but does
# NOT actually transmit the message (dev-only fallback).
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
